{"id":8867218489543,"title":"Softball-Themed Bedding for Girls and Women – Bright Teal Yellow","handle":"softball-themed-bedding-for-girls-and-women-bright-teal-yellow","description":"\u003cp\u003eSupport your favorite sport with this vibrant Softball-Themed Comforter Set from Jeminise, perfect for softball players and fans alike. Designed to bring a relaxing and spirited feel to any bedroom, this set offers both comfort and a unique style.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Theme:\u003c\/strong\u003e Show your dedication to softball with a spirited design that celebrates the courage of supporting your team.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose from Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to fit your bed perfectly.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSuperior Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, and durable feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFade-Resistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features environmental protection finishing techniques to ensure the fabric holds onto its vibrant dyes and prevents fading over time.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBreathable Comfort:\u003c\/strong\u003e Microfiber material is cool and breathable, offering greater durability than cotton for long-lasting enjoyment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e This comforter set is machine washable and dries quickly, making maintenance simple and convenient.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Each set includes a soft and comfortable comforter.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBran